#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tipkovnica za Android"

#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid ""
"Swajp – swipe keyboard for Android, no internet access, offline dictation."
msgstr ""
"Swajp – tipkovnica za pisanje potezima za Android, bez pristupa internetu, izvanmrežno diktiranje."

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Početna"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Languages"
msgstr "Jezici"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Privacy"
msgstr "Privatnost"

#: index languages privacy licenses
msgid "Licenses"
msgstr "Licence"

#: index
msgid "Swajp – Anax Keyboard"
msgstr "Swajp – Anax tipkovnica"

#: index
msgid "A keyboard<br><em>fit for an emperor.</em>"
msgstr "Tipkovnica<br><em>dostojna cara.</em>"

#: index
msgid "Swift as Anax – the emperor dragonfly.<br>Precise as its hunt."
msgstr "Brza kao Anax – vilin konjic veliki car.<br>Precizna kao njegov lov."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Inspired by Swype. Born as Swajp.</strong> An Android keyboard you type on with a glide of your finger. It guesses words from context, learns your style, and all your data stays on your phone."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nadahnuta Swypeom. Rođena kao Swajp.</strong> Tipkovnica za Android na kojoj pišeš klizanjem prsta. Riječi pogađa iz konteksta, uči tvoj stil, a svi tvoji podaci ostaju u telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Coming soon to Google Play"
msgstr "Uskoro na Google Playu"

#: index languages
msgid "Language packs"
msgstr "Jezični paketi"

#: index
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Mogućnosti"

#: index
msgid "Swipe typing"
msgstr "Pisanje potezima"

#: index
msgid "Glide over the letters and the word appears."
msgstr "Prijeđi prstom preko slova i riječ se pojavi."

#: index
msgid "Word prediction"
msgstr "Predviđanje riječi"

#: index
msgid "Suggests the next word from what you type."
msgstr "Nudi sljedeću riječ prema onome što pišeš."

#: index
msgid "Gestures & text editing"
msgstr "Geste i uređivanje teksta"

#: index
msgid "Copy, paste, undo and select with one swipe."
msgstr "Kopiraj, zalijepi, poništi i označi jednim potezom."

#: index
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emotikoni"

#: index
msgid "Type a word and the emoji flies in."
msgstr "Napiši riječ i emotikon doleti."

#: index
msgid "Two languages at once, 35 in total."
msgstr "Dva jezika odjednom, ukupno 35."

#: index
msgid "Offline dictation"
msgstr "Izvanmrežno diktiranje"

#: index
msgid "Speech to text right on your phone."
msgstr "Govor u tekst izravno u telefonu."

#: index
msgid "Clipboard history"
msgstr "Povijest međuspremnika"

#: index
msgid "Your last 30 copied texts at hand."
msgstr "Zadnjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvijek pri ruci."

#: index
msgid "Number pad & calculator"
msgstr "Brojčanik i kalkulator"

#: index
msgid "Big digits, a calculator and a scientific one."
msgstr "Velike znamenke, kalkulator i znanstveni kalkulator."

#: index
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "Sigurnosna kopija"

#: index
msgid "Take your learned words to your new phone."
msgstr "Prenesi naučene riječi na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid "No internet, no ads, no tracking."
msgstr "Bez interneta, bez oglasa, bez praćenja."

#: index
msgid "Glide over the keys like a dragonfly."
msgstr "Kliži po tipkama poput vilinog konjica."

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Previous"
msgstr "Prethodno"

#: index (atribut / attribute)
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Sljedeće"

#: index
msgid ""
"No need to tap letter by letter – one stroke across the letters of a word is enough. Swajp recognises the swipe even when it is not perfect, and learns your style so it keeps getting more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Ne moraš tipkati slovo po slovo – dovoljan je jedan potez preko slova riječi. Swajp prepoznaje potez i kad nije savršen te uči tvoj stil, pa je sve precizniji."

#: index
msgid "Predicts your next word like a dragonfly predicts its prey."
msgstr ""
"Predviđa tvoju sljedeću riječ kao što vilin konjic predviđa let svog plijena."

#: index
msgid ""
"From the words before, it suggests what you are likely to type next, and uses context to tell similar words apart. It learns the words you actually use."
msgstr ""
"Prema prethodnim riječima nudi ono što ćeš vjerojatno napisati sljedeće, a iz konteksta razlikuje i slične riječi. Uči riječi koje ti stvarno koristiš."

#: index
msgid "Rules the air. Now rules your text."
msgstr "Vlada zrakom. Sad vlada i tvojim tekstom."

#: index
msgid ""
"It flies backwards and forwards too – undo and redo, up to 60 steps. Moving the cursor to select or delete text is as precise as landing on a reed. Copy, paste, cut and select all with a swipe from the Swajp key, change case with a single gesture."
msgstr ""
"Leti i unatrag i naprijed – poništi i ponovi, do 60 koraka. Pomicanje kursora pri označavanju ili brisanju teksta precizno je kao slijetanje na trsku. Kopiranje, lijepljenje, izrezivanje i označavanje svega potezom s tipke Swajp, a veličinu slova mijenjaš jednom gestom."

#: index
msgid ""
"All gestures with demos and practice are in the app: Settings → Gestures and guide."
msgstr ""
"Sve geste s prikazima i isprobavanjem nalaze se u aplikaciji: Postavke → Geste i vodič."

#: index
msgid "Catch your emotion mid-air."
msgstr "Uhvati emociju u letu."

#: index
msgid ""
"Swipe or type a word – like “heart”, “beer” or “sad” – and Swajp offers the emoji in the suggestion bar. The :) shortcut works too, or simply pick one from the list."
msgstr ""
"Napiši riječ potezom ili tipkanjem – npr. „srce“, „pivo“ ili „tužan“ – i Swajp ti u traci prijedloga ponudi emotikon. Radi i prečac :), a možeš ga i jednostavno odabrati s popisa."

#: index
msgid "Born to rule – in 35 languages."
msgstr "Rođena da vlada – na 35 jezika."

#: index
msgid ""
"Type in two languages without switching – the keyboard knows words from both. 9 languages are built in (English in two variants), 26 more can be downloaded as packs."
msgstr ""
"Piši na dva jezika bez prebacivanja – tipkovnica poznaje riječi iz oba. 9 jezika ugrađeno je u aplikaciju (engleski u dvije varijante), još 26 možeš preuzeti kao pakete."

#: index
msgid ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Green</span> languages are built in, the others can be <a href=\"languages.html\">downloaded as packs</a>."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:var(--g)\">Zeleno</span> označeni jezici ugrađeni su u aplikaciju, ostale možeš <a href=\"languages.html\">preuzeti kao pakete</a>."

#: index
msgid "Hears you. Tells no one."
msgstr "Čuje te. Nikome ne govori."

#: index
msgid ""
"Speech is turned into text right on your phone (Parakeet and Omnilingual models), with no internet. If you like, you can use Google recognition instead. Recognised words are checked against the dictionary."
msgstr ""
"Govor se pretvara u tekst izravno u telefonu (modeli Parakeet i Omnilingual), bez interneta. Ako želiš, umjesto toga možeš koristiti Googleovo prepoznavanje. Prepoznate riječi provjeravaju se prema rječniku."

#: index
msgid "Remembers your copies. Forgets your secrets."
msgstr "Pamti što kopiraš. Tajne zaboravlja."

#: index
msgid ""
"Your last 30 copied texts are always at hand. Passwords, codes and text marked as sensitive are never stored, and the history clears itself after the time you choose."
msgstr ""
"Zadnjih 30 kopiranih tekstova uvijek ti je pri ruci. Lozinke, kodovi i tekstovi označeni kao osjetljivi nikad se ne spremaju, a povijest se sama briše nakon vremena koje odabereš."

#: index
msgid "Even sharp minds reach for a calculator."
msgstr "I bistroj glavi dobro dođe kalkulator."

#: index
msgid ""
"Big digits for quick entry of phone numbers and amounts. A calculator and a scientific calculator right in the keyboard – no switching apps."
msgstr ""
"Velike znamenke za brz unos telefonskih brojeva i iznosa. Kalkulator i znanstveni kalkulator izravno u tipkovnici – bez prebacivanja u drugu aplikaciju."

#: index
msgid ""
"A dragonfly can cross the sea. Your learned words and typing style can cross to your new phone."
msgstr ""
"Vilin konjic može preletjeti more. Tvoje naučene riječi i stil pisanja mogu preletjeti na novi telefon."

#: index
msgid ""
"Settings, your own words and everything Swajp has learned from your typing go into a single file – load it on your new phone and Swajp types like yours right away. The file stays with you: nothing goes over the internet or to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Postavke, tvoje riječi i sve što je Swajp naučio iz tvog pisanja spremaju se u jednu datoteku – učitaj je na novom telefonu i Swajp odmah piše kao tvoj. Datoteka ostaje kod tebe: ništa ne ide preko interneta ni u oblak."

#: index
msgid "You’re the hunter, never the prey."
msgstr "Ti si lovac, nikad plijen."

#: index
msgid ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Zero tracking, maximum privacy. </strong>Swajp has no internet permission. Nothing you type or dictate offline can leave your phone. No ads, no analytics. Nothing is learned or stored in password fields."
msgstr ""
"<strong class=\"story\">Nikakvo praćenje, najveća privatnost. </strong>Swajp nema dopuštenje za pristup internetu. Ništa što napišeš ili izvanmrežno izdiktiraš ne može napustiti tvoj telefon. Bez oglasa, bez analitike. U poljima za lozinke ništa se ne uči niti sprema."

#: index
msgid "Privacy policy →"
msgstr "Pravila privatnosti →"

#: index
msgid ""
"<span class=\"o1\">They say when a dragonfly lands on you, change is coming into your life.</span>Let this one land on your fingertips."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"o1\">Kažu da kad na tebe sleti vilin konjic, u tvoj život dolazi promjena.</span>Neka ovaj sleti na vrhove tvojih prstiju."

#: languages
msgid "Swajp – language packs"
msgstr "Swajp – jezični paketi"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Languages that are not built into the app can be added as a pack. It is a plain zip with a dictionary – nothing gets installed and the app needs no internet for it."
msgstr ""
"Jezici koji nisu ugrađeni u aplikaciju mogu se dodati kao paket. To je obična zip datoteka s rječnikom – ništa se ne instalira i aplikaciji za to ne treba internet."

#: languages
msgid "How to add a pack"
msgstr "Kako dodati paket"

#: languages
msgid ""
"Download the zip of the language you want. It is saved to your Downloads folder."
msgstr "Preuzmi zip željenog jezika. Spremit će se u mapu Preuzimanja."

#: languages
msgid "Open <b>Swajp → Settings → Languages → More languages (packs)</b>."
msgstr "Otvori <b>Swajp → Postavke → Jezici → Dodatni jezici (paketi)</b>."

#: languages
msgid ""
"Tap <b>Import language packs (one or more)</b> and choose the downloaded file."
msgstr ""
"Dodirni <b>Uvezi jezične pakete (jedan ili više)</b> i odaberi preuzetu datoteku."

#: languages
msgid "Select the new language as your main or second language."
msgstr "Odaberi novi jezik kao glavni ili drugi jezik."

