#: languages privacy licenses
msgid "Swajp – keyboard for Android"
msgstr "Swajp – tipkovnica za Android"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp – Privacy Policy"
msgstr "Swajp – Pravila privatnosti"

#: privacy
msgid "Effective 21 November 2026"
msgstr "Vrijedi od 21. studenoga 2026."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Swajp is an Android keyboard designed so that no data leaves your phone."
msgstr ""
"Swajp je tipkovnica za Android osmišljena tako da nikakvi podaci ne napuštaju tvoj telefon."

#: privacy
msgid "Internet access"
msgstr "Pristup internetu"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"The app does not have the internet permission, so it cannot send anything you type or say. It contains no ads, analytics or trackers."
msgstr ""
"Aplikacija nema dopuštenje za internet, pa ne može poslati ništa što napišeš ili izgovoriš. Ne sadrži oglase, analitiku ni alate za praćenje."

#: privacy
msgid "What is stored and where"
msgstr "Što se sprema i gdje"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Learned words, word pairs and swipe traces</b> are stored only in the app's private storage on your phone to improve suggestions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Naučene riječi, parovi riječi i tragovi poteza</b> spremaju se samo u privatnu pohranu aplikacije na tvom telefonu radi boljih prijedloga."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Clipboard history</b> (if enabled) stays on the phone and is deleted automatically after the chosen time. Text from password fields, text marked sensitive by the system and text that looks like a password or code is never stored."
msgstr ""
"<b>Povijest međuspremnika</b> (ako je uključena) ostaje u telefonu i automatski se briše nakon odabranog vremena. Tekst iz polja za lozinke, tekst koji sustav označi kao osjetljiv i tekst koji izgleda kao lozinka ili kod nikad se ne sprema."

#: privacy
msgid "<b>Settings</b> stay on the phone."
msgstr "<b>Postavke</b> ostaju u telefonu."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Nothing is learned or stored in password fields or in apps that request incognito mode."
msgstr ""
"U poljima za lozinke i u aplikacijama koje traže anonimni način ništa se ne uči niti sprema."

#: privacy
msgid "Microphone and voice input"
msgstr "Mikrofon i glasovni unos"

#: privacy
msgid "The microphone is used only when you start voice input."
msgstr "Mikrofon se koristi samo kad pokreneš glasovni unos."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Offline models</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) convert speech to text on the phone. Audio is not sent anywhere and is not kept."
msgstr ""
"<b>Izvanmrežni modeli</b> (Parakeet, Omnilingual) pretvaraju govor u tekst u telefonu. Zvuk se nikamo ne šalje i ne čuva se."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"<b>Google recognition</b> (if you choose it) uses the Android system speech recognition service; Google processes the audio under its own policy: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp itself sends nothing."
msgstr ""
"<b>Googleovo prepoznavanje</b> (ako ga odabereš) koristi Androidovu sustavnu uslugu prepoznavanja govora; Google obrađuje zvuk prema vlastitim pravilima: <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\">policies.google.com/privacy</a>. Swajp sam ne šalje ništa."

#: privacy
msgid ""
"You download voice models yourself in your browser; the app does not need the internet for that."
msgstr ""
"Glasovne modele preuzimaš sam u pregledniku; aplikaciji za to ne treba internet."

#: privacy
msgid "Export and import"
msgstr "Izvoz i uvoz"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"A backup is created only on your request, into a file you choose. It is never sent automatically."
msgstr ""
"Sigurnosna kopija izrađuje se samo na tvoj zahtjev, u datoteku koju odabereš. Nikad se ne šalje automatski."

#: privacy
msgid "Sharing"
msgstr "Dijeljenje"

#: privacy
msgid "Swajp does not sell, share or transfer any data to third parties."
msgstr ""
"Swajp ne prodaje, ne dijeli niti prenosi nikakve podatke trećim stranama."

#: privacy
msgid "Deleting data"
msgstr "Brisanje podataka"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Delete learned data in settings (Learning → “Smazat vše naučené”) or uninstall the app to remove everything."
msgstr ""
"Izbriši naučene podatke u postavkama (Riječi i učenje → „Izbriši sve naučeno“) ili deinstaliraj aplikaciju da ukloniš sve."

#: privacy
msgid "Children"
msgstr "Djeca"

#: privacy
msgid "The app collects no personal data, including from children."
msgstr "Aplikacija ne prikuplja nikakve osobne podatke, pa ni od djece."

#: privacy
msgid "Changes and contact"
msgstr "Promjene i kontakt"

#: privacy
msgid ""
"Changes will be published on this page. Questions: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"
msgstr ""
"Promjene će biti objavljene na ovoj stranici. Pitanja: <a href=\"mailto:swajp.keyboard@gmail.com\">swajp.keyboard@gmail.com</a>"

#: privacy
msgid "Developer: Aleš Brunner, Czech Republic"
msgstr "Razvojni programer: Aleš Brunner, Češka"

